    (KEGG gene sets)
  - results/biological_impact/reference_edge_sets/reactome_gene_sets.json
    (Reactome gene sets)
  - results/biological_impact/reference_edge_sets/string_ppi_edges.json
    (STRING protein pairs)
  - src/02_cssi_method/cssi_real_data/results/trrust_human.tsv
    (the TRRUST human TF-target table)
