4. OUTPUTS OF THIRD-PARTY MODELS
--------------------------------

Many files hold values computed by running public models on the data above:
activations, embeddings, attention scores and sparse-autoencoder codes. The
models are MaxToki-217M, Geneformer V2-316M, scGPT whole-human, STATE
SE-600M, ESM-2 650M (facebook/esm2_t33_650M_UR50D; licence field "mit" on
its Hugging Face model card) and C2S-Scale-Gemma-2-2B
(vandijklab/C2S-Scale-Gemma-2-2B; its model card says "The model weights
shared on Huggingface are CC-by-4.0"). These files are results of this
project, but the terms of the model and of the input data may also apply.
See each source.


5. JAVASCRIPT LIBRARIES OF THE WEB ATLAS
----------------------------------------

The built web atlas (projects/maxtoki/runs/sae-atlas-217M/atlas/dist/) is
not in this release (EXCLUDED.csv). Building it with `npm ci && npm run
build` in the atlas folder downloads open-source libraries, each under its
own licence: React and React Router (MIT), plotly.js (MIT,
https://github.com/plotly/plotly.js) and the libraries plotly.js includes,
for example MapLibre GL JS (3-Clause BSD). The full dependency list is in
projects/maxtoki/runs/sae-atlas-217M/atlas/package.json and
package-lock.json.


6. LATEX BIBLIOGRAPHY STYLE
