7. RECORDS FROM PUBLIC WEB SERVICES
-----------------------------------

projects/maxtoki/checks/d12_deployment_facts/inputs/ and
projects/maxtoki/checks/d12_deployment_facts/verification/inputs/ hold what
the Hugging Face and Zenodo web services returned for public repositories
named in this file: file lists, commit lists and repository details of
theodoris-lab/MaxToki, ctheodoris/Geneformer and
arcinstitute/State-Replogle-Filtered on Hugging Face, and details of the
scPerturb records on Zenodo. The checks read them. They hold no model
weights and no data values. See the source.


